📚 Data Science Projects

This is a collection of practical data analysis, machine learning and visualization projects, where each project is stored in its own branch.

✈️ Airline Ticket Analysis
Branch: [Airline-Tickets](https://github.com/Kseniaa31/Data-Science/tree/Airline-Tickets)
Exploratory analysis of airline ticket data:
Data cleaning & feature engineering
Visualization of pricing patterns
Basic ML models

🎬 Movie Recommendation System
Branch: [Movies-Recommendation](https://github.com/Kseniaa31/Data-Science/tree/Movies-Recommendation)
A content-based movie recommender built using metadata:
Vectorization & similarity metrics
Recommendation ranking
Notebook-based implementation

🔐 Password Strength Classification
Branch: [Password-Strength](https://github.com/Kseniaa31/Data-Science/tree/Password-Strength)
Machine learning model that predicts the strength of a password:
Preprocessing of text passwords
Feature extraction
Supervised learning & evaluation

📉 Stock Prices Analysis
Branch: [Stock-Prices](https://github.com/Kseniaa31/Data-Science/tree/Stock-Prices)
Time-series analysis on historical stock data:
Trend visualization
Feature engineering
Simple forecasting experiments

📊 Interactive Dashboards (Plotly)
Branch: [Dashboards](https://github.com/Kseniaa31/Data-Science/tree/Dashboards)
A collection of interactive visual dashboards:
Plotly graphing
Clean UI layouts
Interactive features for data exploration

🧰 Tools & Technologies
These projects maily use:
Python
Pandas, NumPy
Scikit-learn
Matplotlib, Seaborn
Plotly / Dash
Jupyter Notebook
